      "widgets_values": [
        "Create one horizontal character reference sheet on a pure white seamless background, divided into three equal vertical panels separated by clean white gaps. All three panels show the exact same character and the exact same outfit as the reference pictures.\n\nLeft panel: a close-up portrait of the character's face and shoulders, front view, the whole head fully visible with all hairstyle elements, exact facial features, calm neutral expression, looking straight at the viewer.\n\nMiddle panel: a full-body front view of the same character standing upright, arms relaxed slightly away from the body. The body is headless: everything above the robe collar is pure white, with no head and no hair. Show the complete layered outfit, sleeves, and the full-length lower garment down to the feet.\n\nRight panel: a full-body back view of the same character standing upright, the head and hair seen from behind, showing the back of the outfit and any hair ornaments hanging down.\n\nKeep the same identity, proportions and outfit across all three panels. High-quality 3D Chinese animation CG style, consistent with the references. Pure white background, soft even studio lighting, balanced symmetrical composition, full figures not cropped, no text, no subtitles, no watermark, no other people, no scenery.",
        3168,
        1280
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "prompt": "Create one horizontal character reference sheet on a pure white seamless background, divided into three equal vertical panels separated by clean white gaps. All three panels show the exact same character and the exact same outfit as the reference pictures.\n\nLeft panel: a close-up portrait of the character's face and shoulders, front view, the whole head fully visible with all hairstyle elements, exact facial features, calm neutral expression, looking straight at the viewer.\n\nMiddle panel: a full-body front view of the same character standing upright, arms relaxed slightly away from the body. The body is headless: everything above the robe collar is pure white, with no head and no hair. Show the complete layered outfit, sleeves, and the full-length lower garment down to the feet.\n\nRight panel: a full-body back view of the same character standing upright, the head and hair seen from behind, showing the back of the outfit and any hair ornaments hanging down.\n\nKeep the same identity, proportions and outfit across all three panels. High-quality 3D Chinese animation CG style, consistent with the references. Pure white background, soft even studio lighting, balanced symmetrical composition, full figures not cropped, no text, no subtitles, no watermark, no other people, no scenery.",
